  "html": "<p><b>The basic theme of the Algernon Dungeon centers around the Fizz Rock Miners, the transmutation of Fizz Rock into FizzStar drinks, and their sale in the <i>Squeakeasies</i>.  In addition Sir Kent the Artisan gives an offbeat series of quests that are fun to do, and the <i>Exploring</i> and <i>Search and Destroy</i> quests are introduced.  As there is no Base Camp for Algernon most of the quests are given by NPC's in Townston.</b>\n</p>\n\n<div id=\"mw-subcategories\">\n<h2>Subcategories</h2>\n<p>There are 8 subcategories to this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>A</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Algernon_Mutant_Quests\" title=\"Category:Algernon Mutant Quests\">Algernon Mutant Quests</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Algernon_Orok_Quests\" title=\"Category:Algernon Orok Quests\">Algernon Orok Quests</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>A cont.</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Audit_Algernon_Quests\" title=\"Category:Audit Algernon Quests\">Audit Algernon Quests</a></li></ul>\n<h3>F</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Fizz_Quests\" title=\"Category:Fizz Quests\">Fizz Quests</a></li></ul>\n<h3>H</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Hide_and_Seek_Quest_Line\" title=\"Category:Hide and Seek Quest Line\">Hide and Seek Quest Line</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>M</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Mission_Important_Quests\" title=\"Category:Mission Important Quests\">Mission Important Quests</a></li></ul>\n<h3>R</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Rattle_Tooth's_Kinfolk_Quest_Line\" title=\"Category:Rattle Tooth's Kinfolk Quest Line\">Rattle Tooth's Kinfolk Quest Line</a></li></ul>\n<h3>S</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Sir_Kent_the_Artisan_Quests\" title=\"Category:Sir Kent the Artisan Quests\">Sir Kent the Artisan Quests</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n</tr></table>\n</div><div id=\"mw-pages\">\n<h2>Articles in category \"Algernon Quests\"</h2>\n<p>There are 50 articles in this category.\n</p><table wid